WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.035 --> 00:00:03.198
Oh man, it's Bill Belichick's house

00:00:03.198 --> 00:00:05.097
Aw cool, Super Bowl rings!

00:00:05.102 --> 00:00:06.818
Hey, guys, look! I'm Bill Russell Wilson!

00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:08.007
Jameis, what are you doing?

00:00:08.007 --> 00:00:08.614
Get back here

00:00:08.614 --> 00:00:10.753
C'mon Matt, it's just a little QB sneak

00:00:10.753 --> 00:00:12.876
Huh, guys I don't know about this...

00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:18.418
Can't believe how easy it was to sneak in here

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:19.583
I know. It's like getting through your

00:00:19.583 --> 00:00:20.585
offensive line

00:00:20.585 --> 00:00:21.274
Heyyy...

00:00:21.274 --> 00:00:22.274
Whoa, check it out!

00:00:22.502 --> 00:00:23.162
What the...?

00:00:23.162 --> 00:00:24.312
He's got a clone army of...

00:00:24.677 --> 00:00:25.510
Gronks

00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.001
No wonder he's playing every week

00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:28.531
Goodell needs to know about this

00:00:28.531 --> 00:00:30.592
Shall I intercept them, Mr. Belichick?

00:00:30.592 --> 00:00:31.646
Yes Malcolm

00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:32.928
What is all this?

00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:34.610
It's like some sort of new play or something

00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:35.853
Oh shi...

00:00:35.853 --> 00:00:37.543
Aaaaah!!! KILL KILL KILL!

00:00:38.046 --> 00:00:40.452
I see you gentlemen have found my latest cheat

00:00:40.701 --> 00:00:42.096
The human centerpede

00:00:42.101 --> 00:00:44.426
You see, Tom is getting old and needs

00:00:44.431 --> 00:00:45.892
extra protection

00:00:45.892 --> 00:00:46.525
Genius

00:00:46.525 --> 00:00:48.316
He can take snaps from shotgun and still

00:00:48.316 --> 00:00:49.212
be under center

00:00:49.212 --> 00:00:50.692
You've gone too far, Belichick!

00:00:50.688 --> 00:00:53.065
Too bad there's nobody who can stop me

00:00:53.065 --> 00:00:54.691
Oh there you guys are!

00:00:54.691 --> 00:00:56.914
Sorry I'm late. I took a lot of sacks

00:00:56.914 --> 00:00:59.920
Aaahhhh my kryptonite, Eli Manning!!!!

